MID_LGV_Divination_Start_TypeA_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Start_TypeA_m01_001: Welcome. I'm going to use the 64 hexagrams\nto provide you a personalized reading.
MID_LGV_Divination_Start_TypeB_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Start_TypeB_m01_001: Remember that these readings only indicate which\nway things are flowing, not a specific future.
MID_LGV_Divination_Start_TypeC_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Start_TypeC_m01_001: This reading differs from the oracles in the temple.\nWith this, it's more like the readings performed by\nthe ancients.
MID_LGV_Divination_Start_TypeD_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Start_TypeD_m01_001: The guidance from the reading will be vague, so how\nyou interpret and apply it is your responsibility.
MID_LGV_Divination_OtherRoute_FirstTime_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_OtherRoute_FirstTime_m01_001: If you'd like, I can perform a personalized reading for\nyou. I'll even give you a special discount.
MID_LGV_Divination_Close_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Close_m01_001: That's all I can do for now.
MID_LGV_Divination_Come_Customer_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Come_Customer_m01_001: <TLP>{Variable=0} wants their fortune told.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m04_001: This is quite a good fortune!
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m04_002: <ICA>Suggest they should accept the reading.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m04_003: <ICB>Offer a different interpretation.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m05_001: All seems well.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m05_002: <ICA>Suggest they should accept the reading.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m05_003: <ICB>Offer a different interpretation.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m06_001: This is a bit worrisome.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m06_002: <ICA>Suggest they should accept the reading.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m06_003: <ICB>Offer a different interpretation.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m07_001: This is very bad news.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m07_002: <ICA>Suggest they should accept the reading.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m07_003: <ICB>Offer a different interpretation.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m02_001: <TLP>Suggested the reading is unmistakable.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Reaction_m03_001: <TLP>Explained a different way to understand the reading.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_MainCharacter_Reaction_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_MainCharacter_Reaction_m01_001: <TLP>That seems good.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_MainCharacter_Reaction_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_MainCharacter_Reaction_m02_001: <TLP>Hmm. Not bad at all.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_MainCharacter_Reaction_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_MainCharacter_Reaction_m03_001: <TLP>Well, that's worrisome.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Customer_Reaction_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Customer_Reaction_m01_001: <TLP>{Variable=0} seems pleased with their fortune.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Customer_Reaction_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Customer_Reaction_m02_001: <TLP>{Variable=0} understood the results.
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Customer_Reaction_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_result_Customer_Reaction_m03_001: <TLP>{Variable=0} looked a bit unnerved.
MID_LGV_Divination_Continue_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Continue_m01_001: Should I continue telling fortunes?
MID_LGV_Divination_Continue_m01_002: <ICA>Continue.
MID_LGV_Divination_Continue_m01_003: <ICB>Stop.
MID_LGV_Divination_Continue_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Continue_m02_001: I feel like I'm doing really well today. \nShould I continue telling fortunes?
MID_LGV_Divination_Continue_m02_002: <ICA>Continue.
MID_LGV_Divination_Continue_m02_003: <ICB>Stop.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m01_001: Qian, Initiating. A heavy responsibility will be placed\non you. Expect to be under constant tension.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m01_002: Try not to push yourself too hard right now. The key\nis to take things easy until the difficulty passes.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m02_001: Kun, Responding. This hexagram represents Mother\nEarth and suggests a time of gentle protection.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m02_002: In times of distress, it's best not to resist. Try to\ndeal with trouble like a willow that bends in a\nstrong wind. Good fortune will surely come.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m03_001: Zhun, Beginning. Is it possible you're feeling a strong\nsense of stagnation? Perhaps you find yourself\nstruggling a bit?
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m03_002: No matter your current difficulty, once you get\nthrough it, your path will open.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m03_003: But be sure to avoid taking the easy way or using\nshortcuts now. Be patient, focused, and happiness\nwill come.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m04_001: Meng, Childhood. This represents an uncertain state\nof affairs and poor prospects. You'll find it difficult\nto resolve your current situation on your own.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m04_002: Seek out a good mentor. Their advice might be able\nto help you find your way.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m05_001: Xü, Needing. Your troubles should be endured for a\nlittle while. For now, it's important that you take\nyour time to observe your situation.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m05_002: Just as rain must eventually fall from the sky, the\nopportunity you're waiting for will surely arrive.\nYou just need to be patient.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m06_001: Song, Contention. There's a big conflict going on\nin your life.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m06_002: Consider your current situation carefully. You should\nunderstand that sharing your opinion right now\nmight not be the best plan.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m07_001: Shi, Multitude. Imagine a warrior, carving their way\nthrough many obstacles with skill and speed.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m07_002: Take time to carefully consider how you should act.\nOnce you find your answer, move forward with\nfull force.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m08_001: Bi, Union. You're in a period of time where you're\nmore likely to get help from others.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m08_002: This is a good time to build relationships with many\npeople. But be selective about the friends that\nyou choose.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m09: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m09_001: Xiao Xü, Little Accumulation. There's a clear\nstagnation in your life at the moment.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m09_002: But taking action right now won't improve your\nsituation if the opportunity isn't right. Be patient\nand wait.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m10: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m10_001: Lü, Fulfillment. Sometimes it's good to rely on others.\nDoing so will solve your current problem.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m10_002: Respect others and treat them with courtesy. Don't\nforget to be humble and obey those above you.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m11: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m11_001: Tai, Advance. This is an ideal state. The people and\ncircumstances in your life are good, and there's a\nfeeling of contentment for everyone.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m11_002: You'll know happiness for a while. But be careful not\nto become arrogant. And don't forget that, even now,\nyou ought to begin preparing for the next disruption.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m12: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m12_001: Pi, Hindrance. This is a barren period where, even if\nyou're chasing the correct goal, you won't prevail.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m12_002: You should understand that the timing is just bad\nright now. You'll be stuck in all directions for some\ntime to come.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m12_003: Remember, even if you know your opinion is totally\ncorrect, it's best if you stay quiet for now. Focus on\nprotecting yourself, and avoid trivial conflicts.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m13: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m13_001: Tong Ren, Seeking Harmony. If you strive to be fair\nand honest with everyone, you'll be able to meet\nand work with like-minded people.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m13_002: However, it's crucial for you to carefully assess any\npotential partner. Make sure you choose someone\nthat you can truly trust.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m14: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m14_001: Da You, The Great Harvest. You're shining like the\nsun and are in a period of great energy.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m14_002: Your physical and mental strength are currently at\ntheir best, but be careful not to get too carried away.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m15: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m15_001: Qian, Humbleness. Being humble now will allow you\nto shine and help you to achieve your ambitions.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m15_002: Keep in mind that being overly humble can lead to\nthinking less of yourself. Be careful, or you might\ncause yourself to stray from the path of success.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m16: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m16_001: Yü, Delight. This represents a time when many\nthings will start to move, similar to how plants\nbegin to sprout in the springtime.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m16_002: But even if it seems like things are going exactly\nlike you want them to, continue pushing forward\nif you want to find success.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m17: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m17_001: Sui, Following. In times like this, it's better to follow\nsomeone else than it is to work independently.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m17_002: Still, don't lose your sense of self. Pay attention, and\nbe ready when the right opportunity presents itself\nto strike out on your own.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m18: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m18_001: Gu, Remedying. Things may seem calm enough on\nthe surface, but there are lots of problems below.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m18_002: If you see any wrongdoings or questionable\nbehaviors, do what you can to correct them.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m19: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m19_001: Lin, Approaching. Like flowers blooming in spring,\nfortune flourishes and progress is made.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m19_002: Keep in mind that if you get too relaxed, you'll miss\nyour opportunity. It's important for you to act\nquickly when the moment arrives.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m20: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m20_001: Guan, Watching. It's crucial to pay attention to your\nsituation and to be sincere about your life choices.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m20_002: It's probably best to maintain the status quo for now.\nBut use this downtime to study, so you can broaden\nyour horizons and be prepared for the future.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m21: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m21_001: Shi He, Eradicating. There's momentum, but you\nstill have problems blocking your way.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m21_002: Being indecisive will only harm you. Take a strong\nstance, and you'll find your path.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m22: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m22_001: Bi, Adorning. A sunset is beautiful to look at, but its\nrapidly dimming light never lasts for very long.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m22_002: It's important to resist the urge to focus solely on\nyour appearance. Make an effort to cultivate your\ninner beauty instead.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m23: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m23_001: Bo, Falling Away. The terrifying image of everything\nsliding away from under you in a landslide.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m23_002: Caution should be your plan for now, or you may find\nyour world slipping away.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m24: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m24_001: Fu, Turning Back. A hopeful time, like a long winter\ndrawing to a close as spring finally arrives.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m24_002: Remember, it's important not to rush into things.\nStart small, and regain the strength you lost \nduring your winter months.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m25: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m25_001: Wu Wang, Without Falsehood. Let go of your inner\nnegativity, and follow the path of least resistance.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m25_002: Clear your mind, free yourself from desire, and don't\nresist the will of the universe.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m26: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m26_001: Da Xü, Great Accumulation. This is a good time for\nyou to gather wealth and knowledge.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m26_002: All eyes are focused on you. Be daring. Move beyond\nthe expectations of others, and focus on the task of\nimproving yourself.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m27: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m27_001: Yi, Nourishing. Consider that the words you say,\nor even the food you eat, might bring disaster.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m27_002: It's best to keep things in moderation. After all, you\ndon't have to eat until you're stuffed.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m28: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m28_001: Da Guo, Great Exceeding. Soon, your true strength\nwill be tested.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m28_002: It's best not to make any rash decisions. Instead, \nbuild your foundation and prepare for the\nchallenges ahead.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m29: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m29_001: Kan, Darkness. You're in an extremely difficult\nsituation and likely feel like you've fallen to\nthe bottom of a deep hole.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m29_002: It's only going to get harder from here. Difficulties\nare increasing, one after another, and more are\nrapidly approaching.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m29_003: Tell yourself this is rock bottom, and you can't go\nany lower. If you can endure this moment, you'll\nnaturally find your way back into the light.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m30: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m30_001: Li, Brightness. Your body will soon be filled with\na power as strong as the sun. This is a good time\nto push forward with your goals.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m30_002: You can expect to achieve great things, but be\ncareful you don't intimidate people around you.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m31: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m31_001: Xian, Mutual Influence. The balance of yin and\nyang is excellent. You can expect good results\nin both romance and marriage.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m31_002: Because this hexagram represents harmony, this\ncould be a good time for business negotiations.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m32: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m32_001: Heng, Long Lasting. Life will continue to be stable\nwithout positive or negative changes.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m32_002: It's important not to try anything new right now.\nFocus on continuing your current efforts.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m33: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m33_001: Dun, Retreat. Your body's yin energy is increasing,\nwhich means your luck will soon begin to run out.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m33_002: It's crucial you know when to back away gracefully,\nso you can avoid any major conflicts.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m34: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m34_001: Da Zhuang, Great Strength. Your body is filling with\nyang energy, and you are becoming stronger.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m34_002: But moving too quickly can lead to failure. Before\nacting, take a step back, and calmly observe the\nstate of your life as a whole.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m35: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m35_001: Jin, Proceeding Forward. The sun is rising and\nbringing good fortune with it.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m35_002: Now's the time to be proactive. Do that, and your\ngoals will most likely be achieved.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m36: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m36_001: Ming Yi, Brilliance Injured. The sun is setting, and\nyour fortunes are sinking with it.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m36_002: Now's a good time for you to hide your talents.\nPretend to be incompetent, and do what you can\nto not stand out.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m37: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m37_001: Jia Ren, Household. You have a good relationship\nwhere both parties uplift each other, like fire\nis helped by the wind.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m37_002: Nurture the bonds you have with the people closest\nto you. It's essential you're considerate and\ncooperative with one another.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m38: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m38_001: Kui, Diversity. There's elements of rebellion and\ndefiance, even an ongoing conflict of opinion,\nwithin your group.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m38_002: For now, it might be important to pay attention and\nto compromise on some things with your partners.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m39: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m39_001: Jian, Hardship. There are things blocking your way,\nleading to difficult situations and even some\nstagnation.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m39_002: It's very dangerous to change your habits in these\ntroubling times. Please, be careful and stay aware\nof your situation.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m39_003: For now, you should probably avoid traveling at\nnight or walking in dangerous areas. Try to follow\nthe smoothest path you can find.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m40: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m40_001: Jie, Relief. Now's when you should be proactive and\ntake action to resolve problems in your life.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m40_002: Making quick decisions will lead to good fortune.\nYour luck's on the rise, so act with confidence.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m41: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m41_001: Sun, Decreasing. Even a choice you made knowing\nfull well it would end up as a loss might still end up\nbringing you good luck.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m41_002: For best results, be considerate to others and give\nway to them when you can.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m42: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m42_001: Yi, Increasing. It's a time of grace. You'll find it's\neasier than usual to gain cooperation from others.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m42_002: If you are going to start something big, now is the\ntime. Act quickly, and you'll find good results.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m43: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m43_001: Guai, Eliminating. Now may not be the best time for\nyou to take action.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m43_002: Right now, be careful of misfortune. The opportunity\nyou're seeking will come around again soon.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m44: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m44_001: Gou, Encountering. The rise of yin energy\nmight cause some unexpected bad luck.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m44_002: Be careful about your relationships with others.\nIt'd be a good idea to pay special attention to how\neveryone around you is behaving.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m45: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m45_001: Cui, Bringing Together. People and resources are\ncoming to you in abundance.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m45_002: Be generous to everyone around you. It'll likely lead\nto greater prosperity than if you were being stingy.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m46: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m46_001: Sheng, Growing Upward. It's a time of rising, when\nplants sprout and we see great growth.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m46_002: Don't be too hasty looking for results. It's important\nto take your time and build up steadily.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m47: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m47_001: Kun, Weariness. This is... Well, it's uncomfortable\nto explain it to you.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m47_002: You're about to have severe difficulties in your life.\nYou'll feel lost, and you'll suffer...greatly.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m47_003: But, like they say, nothing lasts forever. Good times\nalways follow bad. You'll just have to believe that\nuntil you overcome your troubles.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m48: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m48_001: Jing, Replenishing. Self-awareness, faithfulness to\nyour duties, and an unchanging attitude.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m48_002: For now, you should accept where you are in life,\nand do as little as possible to upset the status quo.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m49: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m49_001: Ge, Abolishing the Old. A collision of the old and\nnew is about to bring great change.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m49_002: It's time to throw away outdated ideas and bring in\nthe new. Then things can start moving in a\npositive direction. 
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m50: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m50_001: Ding, Establishing the New. Stability, and even\nbalance, can be yours through harmony.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m50_002: When you're in trouble, it's better if you ask the\nopinions of people around you than it is to try\nand rely entirely on your own judgment.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m51: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m51_001: Zhen, Taking Action. You'll lose control of your\nemotions and affect those around you, for better\nor worse.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m51_002: Be a little more cautious with your behavior than\nusual, and try to keep your emotions in check.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m52: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m52_001: Gen, Keeping Still. Now is not the time to make\nany moves in life.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m52_002: Remain motionless, like a mountain, and calmly\nconsider your current situation. Avoid any kind\nof change.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m53: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m53_001: Jian, Developing Gradually. Your current situation\nwill progress, if you take the correct steps.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m53_002: Things are definitely going in the direction you want,\nso believe in yourself and keep moving forward.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m54: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m54_001: Gui Mei, Marrying Maiden. You're easily caught up\nin your immediate desires.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m54_002: Don't get swept up in temporary emotions. Try to\nstay thoughtful.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m55: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m55_001: Feng, Abundance. You're filled with vitality, and that\ngives you the momentum to get things done the way\nyou want them to be done.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m55_002: Don't put things off. Making decisions quickly will\nhelp you to steer your life in a good direction.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m56: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m56_001: Lü, Traveling. Life is a journey that wanders\naimlessly, surrounding you in uncertainty.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m56_002: Try not to worry too much about the future, even if\nyou feel like you're constantly facing loneliness.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m57: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m57_001: Xun, Proceeding Humbly. You might be experiencing\na case of anxiety or be feeling like life is unstable.\nBut there's no need to be afraid.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m57_002: Talk to someone you respect, and let their advice\nhelp you find your way.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m58: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m58_001: Dui, Joyful. You feel easily drawn to pleasure in this\ntime of temptation.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m58_002: Just remember that your mouth can get you into\ntrouble, so keep all discussions calm and peaceful.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m59: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m59_001: Huan, Dispersing. A change in surroundings might\nbe what you need to solve some of the biggest\nproblems in your life.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m59_002: Then again, if your current situation in life is a stable\none, you might lose something in the process.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m60: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m60_001: Jie, Restricting. Be mindful and maintain\nmoderation. Remember, too much of a\ngood thing is bad for you.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m60_002: It's a bad idea both to overspend and to cut back\ntoo much. Everything in moderation.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m61: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m61_001: Zhong Fu, Innermost Sincerity. Someone is bound by\na deep relationship built on trust.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m61_002: Now's a good time to approach everything in your\nlife with harmony, instead of being stubborn.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m62: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m62_001: Xiao Guo, Little Exceeding. Your life is unbalanced\nwith too much yin energy. If you feel like you're\nspinning your wheels, be careful in your choices.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m62_002: Avoid making any big plans for a bit, and try to keep\na calm attitude towards everything.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m63: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m63_001: Ji Ji, Already Fulfilled. Your current situation has\nalready been completed, and all is stable.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m63_002: Fortune is smiling on everything you do, but now is\nalso the time to start preparing for future trouble.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m64: <TH>
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m64_001: Wei Ji, Not Yet Fulfilled. A great deal of effort is\nrequired to complete your goals.
MID_LGV_Divination_Result_m64_002: Still, if you want to start taking action to accomplish\nsomething, now is the perfect time.